  "_doc": "#1746 the SSHd verdict table, shared by the webserver (server/src/sshd_status.rs) and the SuperApp strip (launcher/SshdVerdict.kt): each case lists the checks (id, required, ok = true | false | null for not checked) and the verdict + failed ids both implementations must return. green = every required check passed; amber = some passed, some failed (failed lists which); red = none passed (off); grey = nothing required has been checked yet.",
